Description Task 2: Install packages listed in the service_required_packages variable and notify the Gather facts handler.

Task 3: Configure systemd service
Description Task 3: Create systemd service files from systemd.j2 template for each service in service_list.

Task 4: Configure sysvinit service
Description Task 4: Create sysvinit service files from sysvinit.j2 template for each service in service_list.

